  "${@0} = ({@1}\\cdot {@2} {@3} {@4}\\cdot {@5}; {@6}\\cdot {@7} {@8} {@9}\\cdot {@10}) = {@11}$.": "${@0} = ({@1}\\cdot {@2} {@3} {@4}\\cdot {@5}; {@6}\\cdot {@7} {@8} {@9}\\cdot {@10}) = {@11}$.",
  "${@0} = {@1}$ (pozor, $0! = 1$).": "${@0} = {@1}$ (Achtung, $0! = 1$).",
  "${@0} = {@1}$ pre $x \\in \\{{@2}\\}$.": "${@0} = {@1}$ für $x \\in \\{{@2}\\}$.",
  "${@0} = {@1}$, teda ${@2}$. Korene sú ${@3}$ a ${@4}$; prirodzené je len $n = {@5}$.": "${@0} = {@1}$, also ${@2}$. Die Lösungen sind ${@3}$ und ${@4}$; natürlich ist nur $n = {@5}$.",
  "${@0}^\\circ = {@1}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180} = \\frac{{@2}}{180}\\pi = {@3}$, teda $k = {@4}$.": "${@0}^\\circ = {@1}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180} = \\frac{{@2}}{180}\\pi = {@3}$, also $k = {@4}$.",
  "$|AB| = \\sqrt{({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2} = \\sqrt{{@4} + {@5}} = \\sqrt{{@6}}{@7}$.": "$|AB| = \\sqrt{({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2} = \\sqrt{{@4} + {@5}} = \\sqrt{{@6}}{@7}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = 6\\cdot 6 = 36$. Priaznivých výsledkov je {@0}{@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{36}{@3}$.": "$|\\Omega| = 6\\cdot 6 = 36$. Es gibt {@0} günstige Ergebnisse{@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{36}{@3}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{32}{2} = {@0}$. Priaznivých výberov je {@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{32}{2} = {@0}$. Es gibt {@1} günstige Auswahlen. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$. Priaznivých dvojíc je {@2}. $P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$. Es gibt {@2} günstige Paare. $P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Priaznivé: vyberieme {@3} z {@4} červených a {@5} z {@6} bielych: $\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$. $P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Günstig: Wir wählen {@3} von {@4} roten und {@5} von {@6} weißen: $\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$. $P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$.",
  "$|\\sin(-x)| = |-\\sin x| = |\\sin x|$.": "$|\\sin(-x)| = |-\\sin x| = |\\sin x|$.",
  "(na dve desatinné miesta)": "(auf zwei Dezimalstellen)",
  "(vieš, že $a_{{@0}} = {@1}$)": "(du weißt, dass $a_{{@0}} = {@1}$)",
  "(zlomok v tvare 1/8)": "(Bruch in der Form 1/8)",
  "(zlomok v tvare p/q)": "(Bruch in der Form p/q)",
